            "raw_output": "383:def load_pretrained_weights(model: torch.nn.Module, pretrained_path: Optional[str]) -> None:\n384-    \"\"\"Load pretrained weights into a fine-tuning model, skipping shape-mismatched keys.\n385-\n386-    The pretrained checkpoint was saved from HelioSpectFormer directly, so its keys\n387-    are flat (e.g. ``embedding.proj.weight``).  The composed fine-tuning models\n388-    (HelioSpectformer1D, HelioSpectformer2D) nest the backbone under ``backbone.*``,\n389-    so we try both the original key and the ``backbone.``-prefixed key when matching\n390-    against the current model's state dict.\n391-\n392-    Args:\n393-        model: The fine-tuning model to load weights into.\n394-        pretrained_path: Path to the pretrained checkpoint (.pt file). No-op if None.\n395-    \"\"\"\n396-    if not pretrained_path:\n397-        return\n398-    print(f\"Loading pretrained weights from {pretrained_path}.\")\n399-    model_state = model.state_dict()\n400-    checkpoint_state = torch.load(pretrained_path, weights_only=True, map_location=\"cpu\")\n401-\n402-    remapped = {}\n403-    for k, v in checkpoint_state.items():\n404-        for candidate in (k, f\"backbone.{k}\"):\n405-            if candidate in model_state and hasattr(v, \"shape\") and v.shape == model_state[candidate].shape:\n406-                remapped[candidate] = v\n407-                break\n408-\n409-    model_state.update(remapped)\n410-    model.load_state_dict(model_state, strict=True)\n411-    print(f\"Loaded {len(remapped)} / {len(checkpoint_state)} pretrained weights.\")\n412-\n413-\n414-class UploadBestCheckpointToS3(L.Callback):\n415-    \"\"\"Lightning callback that uploads the best checkpoint to S3 after each validation epoch.\n416-\n417-    - No-op unless ``bucket`` is set (mirrors the ``output.s3_bucket: null`` YAML default).\n418-    - Only runs from global rank 0 under DDP to avoid duplicate uploads.\n419-    - Uses a stable S3 key (``fixed_key_name``) so the latest best is always at a\n420-      predictable location regardless of epoch number.\n421-\n422-    Args:\n423-        checkpoint_cb: The ModelCheckpoint callback whose ``best_model_path`` to watch.\n424-        bucket: S3 bucket name. Pass ``None`` to disable uploads entirely.\n425-        prefix: Key prefix (folder) within the bucket, e.g. ``\"flare/exp_001\"``.\n426-        fixed_key_name: Object name within the prefix. Defaults to ``\"best.ckpt\"``.\n427-    \"\"\"\n428-\n429-    def __init__(\n430-        self,\n431-        checkpoint_cb: ModelCheckpoint,\n432-        bucket: Optional[str],\n433-        prefix: str = \"\",\n434-        fixed_key_name: Optional[str] = \"best.ckpt\",\n435-    ):\n436-        super().__init__()\n437-        self.checkpoint_cb = checkpoint_cb\n438-        self.bucket = bucket\n439-        self.prefix = prefix.strip(\"/\")\n440-        self.fixed_key_name = fixed_key_name\n441-        self.last_uploaded_best = None\n442-        self._s3 = None\n443-\nShell cwd was reset to /home/jovyan/tmp/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/flare_forecast/old-chats-notebooks",
