            "raw_output": "embedding.pos_embed (1, 65536, 1280)\nembedding.patch_embed.proj.weight (1280, 26, 16, 16)\nembedding.patch_embed.proj.bias (1280,)\nunembed.unembed.0.weight (3328, 1280, 1, 1)\nunembed.unembed.0.bias (3328,)\nShell cwd was reset to /home/jovyan/tmp/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/flare_forecast/old-chats-notebooks",
            "status": "completed",
            "tool_call_id": "toolu_bdrk_01X6WmNsfTmnHbbpHSfKnYxE",
