      "body": "wait what file is this editing? we got instructions to fix certain files (namely those had needed head_ in their parts of the defined classes but you're telling me to remove them?? im pretty sure i copied those edits over correctly from the github we had to copy. like im just trying to work on my notebook if possible... idk what you're suggesting or why. \n\nFound bugs on the LoRA implementation.  Everyone needs to patch:\nMake a pull request from the SwRI-IDEA-Lab main branch into your main.\nCommit and push changes in your working branch.\nRun git merge origin/main.\nResolve conflicts.\nManually remove the  nglo: 1 (line 128) config entry from your config file (or it will crash).\nAsk Claude to reconcile any changes you have made to the finetune templates (both notebook and script).",
