            "permission_status": "resolved"
          },
          {
            "raw_output": "  # -- LoRA adapters --\n  # Trainable under use_lora: true = these adapters + every head_* module.\n  # The head is discovered automatically from the head_ naming convention.\n  use_lora: true\n  lora_config:\n    r: 8\n    lora_alpha: 8\n    lora_dropout: 0.1\n    bias: none\n    # fc1/fc2 in all 10 blocks; attn.qkv/attn.proj in the 8 attention blocks.\n    # Dotted names are required: a bare \"proj\" would also match the Conv2d\n    # patch-embedding tokeniser. Never adapted: the spectral complex_weight,\n    # attn.to_dynamic_projection, and the patch embedding.\n    target_modules: [fc1, fc2, attn.qkv, attn.proj]\nShell cwd was reset to /home/jovyan/tmp/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/flare_forecast/old-chats-notebooks",
            "title": "cd surya_workshop && sed -n '139,155p' downstream_apps/template/configs/config_script.yaml",
