            "raw_output": "start_time,peak_time,end_time,GOES_class,AR,CMX,CMX_VALUE,intensity\n1975-11-05T18:35:00,1975-11-05T18:59:00,1975-11-05T19:22:00,C5.0,664,C,5,5.00E-06\n1975-11-06T01:17:00,1975-11-06T01:19:00,1975-11-06T01:26:00,C6.0,664,C,6,6.00E-06\n--- COLS ---\n['start_time', 'peak_time', 'end_time', 'GOES_class', 'AR', 'CMX', 'CMX_VALUE', 'intensity']\n(61210, 8)\n  GOES_class  intensity\n0       C5.0   0.000005\n1       C6.0   0.000006\n2       C3.0   0.000003\n3       C4.0   0.000004\n4       C2.0   0.000002\nShell cwd was reset to /home/jovyan/tmp/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/flare_forecast/old-chats-notebooks",
            "title": "cd flare_forecast && head -3 data/hek_flare_catalog.csv && echo \"--- COLS ---\" && python -c \" import pandas as pd d=pd.read_csv('data/hek_flare_catalog.csv') print(list(d.columns)) print(d.shape) print(d[['GOES_class','intensity']].head() if 'intensity' in d else '') \"",
